{44800}{Me cannot go in Malicorne. People inside can't go out.}
{44820}{Woman ran outside Malicorne.}
{44840}{Magicians not welcome in Malicorne.}
{44860}{Me know Professor Quentin Blafard disappear. Wife think because of mayor of Malicorne.}
{44880}{Soldier at bridge like bottle...}
{44900}{Sorcerer man in prison. He dead soon.}
{44920}{Bandit Neril Tenduil wanted for stealing. Me get 200 coins if me bring he dead or alive. Me talk with guard sergeant for money.}
{44940}{Mayor close old mine.}
{44960}{Merchant Dr. Julius Maximus is near inn. He say have elixir cure tiredness...}
{44980}{Neril Tenduil steal Mendego pendant by three trees south of Malicorne. He hide in caves farther south.}
{45000}{Golim Dradoc not see with no spectacles. Innkeeper say he not hear also. Machines make big noise in workshop.}
{45020}{After magician Erwin Cornebrume killed, nobody in his house.}
{45040}{Doctor say half-ogre die if he not eat Trompelamort mushroom. Me look in old mine for one.}
{45060}{Jacques Trowbridge keep little insects in jars. They very hungry for wood. They be wingless polyopterans. If put jar on wood, they go and eat wood very fast.}
{45080}{Golim Dradoc know many important people.}
{45100}{People say Dr. Julius Maximus's Elixir be good.}
{45120}{House of Madam Lil in Tarant is closed now.}
{45140}{People have see priest Dante.}
{45160}{Old city is under Malicorne.}
{45180}{People see me in Malicorne.}
{45200}{Club in Malicorne for rich people.}
{45220}{Me cannot go in Malicorne. People cannot go out.}
{45240}{Malicorne merchants sell to foreigners, but not buy from them.}
{45260}{Mayor want mine closed because bridge go outside, but mine go outside too.}
{45280}{Me can find dragon blood and elven spring water in old mine.}
{45300}{Erwin Cornebrume dead one week before me go to past.}
{45320}{Passages in old mine fall down. Mine closed.}
{45340}{People say hotel manager and Irina Petroff do things.}
{44901}{Guard arrest magician inside city! He want mayor dead but he dead soon.}
{44921}{Get 200 coins for bringing bandit Neril Tenduil back, dead or alive. He is wanted for stealing.}
{44941}{Mayor close old mine. Nobody go in.}
{44961}{Traveling merchant park wagon behind my inn. People say he have elixir for tiredness. Me think he liar!}
{45001}{Do you know Golim Dradoc? They call him Squinty Golim because he cannot see a thing without his spectacles! They say he even wears them to bed! And he must be going deaf from the din of all that steam machinery. If he ever left his workshop, one could break into his chest without being heard—the noise would cover everything!}
{45021}{Magician Erwin Cornebrume killed three months before. Nobody buy house because people scared...}
{45081}{Do you know Golim Dradoc? They say his influence reaches far... That must come in terribly handy when he needs to scratch his backside...}
{45101}{Me try Dr. Julius Maximus's Elixir. Headaches gone! Doctor be saint!}
{45121}{They say Madam Lil's establishment in Tarant has closed!...}
{45141}{Long ago, I met a priest named Dante at the Sour Barnacle in Black Root. They say he has recently been seen in these parts...}
{45161}{Did you know that Malicorne was built upon the ruins of an ancient city? Entrances to tunnels can still be found here and there, leading to old, partially collapsed cellars.}
{45181}{A suspicious individual reportedly arrived in the city not long ago. An illegal entrant, no doubt. Someone rather like you...}
{45201}{[He looks you over contemptuously.] This club declines further every day. They truly will admit anyone now...}
{45241}{Malicorne's merchants conduct trade only with local residents. If you are not from here, they will gladly sell you their goods, but they will never buy anything from you...}
{45301}{Erwin Cornebrume dead because of sorcery one week before. But he old Malicorne noble and pure human!...}
{45321}{Several passages have collapsed in the old mine. It is closed until further notice.}
{28000}{Mayor say dat Town Gossip at da Inn 'no somet'ing 'bout da Mummy.}
