{24141}{Have you met Mr. Shackleford?  He's Mr. Vorman's lawyer, and takes care of all of his personal affairs.  He's quite an individual!}
{24160}{Uh...sumbuddy say Vermintown a "soshul ex-pediment".}
{24161}{Mr. Vorman founded Vormantown almost 10 years ago...he called it a "social experiment", I think, but I don't know much about things like that...}
{24200}{Silly guys t'ink dey see monsters in cave and stuff.  Dey say it be Meanra and she bad stuff.}
{24201}{Have you heard of the strange beasts?  All different forms have been seen wandering the woods and caves of late.  It is a sure sign that Minra's evil is spreading!}
{24220}{Steelglayd be bad place.  No go ther!  Bad Magik make peepul dye.}
{24221}{Steer clear of the town of Stillglade in your travels, stranger.  An evil witch cursed the town many years ago and the entire town died a slow and painful death.  It is said the curse remains to this day.}
{24240}{Dey say me no shood see calen.  He big deth magik guy.}
{24241}{Have you come across Kallen in your travels?  Quite a powerful necromancer, he is...  But what a twisted sense about him!  Watch out for that one, if you value your sanity!}
{24260}{Me be told to no be seen by Meanra's bad soldurs on big rodes.}
{24261}{Groups of Minra's soldiers have been spotted along the main roads.  Stay out of their way, if you know what's good for you.}
{24280}{Meanra be bad wich.  She lock up qeen in Teer and do sumthin' with throan.  Dey say it bad stuff.}
{24281}{Have you heard about the evils taking place in Tyr, the capital city?  Our queen has been imprisoned by the powerful witch Minra.  I have heard that evil began to spread like a plague the moment Minra took the throne!}
{43500}{Hironeemus Maxum say if I brung him a huntin' rifle, a loading mekanism and a revolver chambur he make me a mekanized gun.}
{44580}{Me just learn of little people legund from Cat-tan about spider-demun called Merow Vort-ahm. The demon make you tink it's a very pretty human woman and den takes over your place an eats you. Heh. Scary bed-time story.}
{44600}{Dere's a large place fur evil dead things just north of Mon-a-co on Cat-tan.}
{44620}{Long ago Cat-tan was called Kai-tan's Abode. Me learn some hist'ry. Heh.}
{44640}{Da Plain-wicke Plan-ta-shun has magick spiders called Merow Vort-ahm. Day trapped on river eye-lund fur now, but dat won't last much longer.}
{44680}{Merow Vort-ahm is not the last of her kind on Cat-tan.}
{44380}{Haunted place just up the road from Lynch-bany. Maybee it be good for sleepin' in after I get rid of ghosties.}
