{44440}{Farmer Maggot is very pro-tec-tive of his taters.}
{44460}{Dah-Keeah Foghat likes young girl name Lee-ka New-ba. Me think he is much too old for her.}
{44480}{Town of Brandy-buck has two honours. It is biggest halfling town and deir sheep makes really softest wool.}
{44500}{Me hear that town of Leahbo cannot call itself a shire anymore. Sometin' to do with too many "long-shanks", the big people, living there.}
{44520}{Heh. Lee-ka New-ba not like Dah-keeah. He too old for her.}
{44540}{Me had always thought "Kill 'em with kindness" was just figger of speach. Today me meet woman named Wee-kee-ia who can do it!}
