{44720}{Man who lives at shore of Ivory Lake has told me that teleport spells do not work once you leave da shore. Strange.}
{44740}{A group of elffies don' like utter peepule moving too close to the forest. I need be care-full when I traval thru dere.}
{44760}{Da town of Marsy-onya shud be gettin' a lot more peepul comin' thru now dat a bridge across the river has been found.}
{30000}{The antique dealer, the castellan, the gardener have things of dead professor Siegfried. There is fine helmet, precious pendant and good gloves.}
